    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The beginning</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New icon of 2D platforms that will try to fight to gain a space in the hearts of lovers of the genre! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join him on his fascinating adventure and celebrate his birth together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Argument</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tragic event, carried out by a group of poachers, shakes the calm life of our emblematic protagonist that will lead him to travel through African lands in search of revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u><strong>Remembering</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nocky the Armadillo seeks to bring back the epic adventures we live on 16-bit consoles, becoming the new star that conquers the new generation of young players and pleases the most veteran players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wonderful soundtrack is made by composer \u00c1lvaro Garc\u00eda Hern\u00e1ndez \u201cLautenor\u201d.</p>",
